---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---

<section class="relative">
  <Verticalgrid />
  <div class="relative max-w-7xl px-8 md:px-12 lg:px-16 mx-auto py-12 lg:py-24  space-y-24">
    <div class="mx-auto text-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm text-transparent uppercase bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-300 to-indigo-400 bg-clip-text">
          COMPLETE MARKETING AUTOMATION FOR ECOMMERCE AND RETAILERS
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-8">
          Intelligent Workflows with Effective Results for Wocommerce
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
            Develop AI-driven workflows to optimize user engagement, retention, and acquisition. Expand your store and increase revenue through automated loyalty marketing strategies.
        </br>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="relative items-center w-full pb-0 mx-auto mt-12 overflow-hidden max-w-7xl lg:p-10 lg:pb-14 "
        style="">
        <img
          class="object-cover w-full -mb-12  rounded-xl border-white/5 lg:rounded-3xl shadow-vulcan-950"
          src="/assets/homepage/Workflow1.png"
          alt="Workflows for Woocommerce gift cards and loyalty program"
        />
      </div>
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 mt-24 lg:text-left sm:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-12"
        role="list">
         <li>
          <div>
            <h3
              class="text-4xl">
              Integrate
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base">
            Seamlessly integrate your WooCommerce store with leading eCommerce platforms and connected apps, enabling more customized workflows. Swiftly produce impactful and streamlined experiences at every point of the customer journey with just a few easy clicks.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-4xl">
              Automate
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base">
Develop customized workflows to roll out sophisticated, data-led marketing initiatives. Smoothly incorporate features such as WooCommerce store credit, coupons, gift cards, and digital wallets into comprehensive workflows crafted to engage, convert, and retain customers.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3
              class="lg:text-4xl">
              Personalize</h3>           
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base">
Craft fully automated, data-centric marketing campaigns customized for your customers. Provide tailored incentives according to each customer's activities and profile, including rewards, cash backs, loyalty points, coupons, gift cards, and store credits, aimed at boosting engagement and loyalty.</p>
        </li>
       
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
